					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3568801#post-3587717</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3568801/mobile-task-force-psi-7-home-improvement-hub#post-3587717</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2017 21:04:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RJB_R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1229263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hey! This is a hub for the task force I've written on the wiki, MTF Psi-7 &quot;Home Improvement&quot;. It's a coldpost, I put this together in an hour because crunching to pack up ahead of Irma and trying to get my math homework done was stressing me out, and this was my way of unwinding. Images are licensed under <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Explosions.jpg">public domain</a>, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_cavalryman_sitting_on_his_horse_on_a_ridge._Man_and_horse_are_black,_outlined_against_a_cloudy_sky._This_photograph_is_symbolic_of_the_last_days_of_the_use_of_cavalry_in_European_warfare._Trench_(4687939107).jpg">Public domain through the national library of Scotland</a> and <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Unidentified_WWI_soldier_(14305510987).jpg">Public Domain through the Florida Memory Project at the State Archive of Florida</a>.</p> <p>The equipment license info can be found <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/forum/t-2245309/ausruestung-der-sicherheitskraefte-der-foundation">here</a>. Descriptions and such were adapted with permission from Dr. Grom.</p> <p>Logo is by Sunny and can be found on the MTF page.</p> <p>Coldpost theater, hope you guys enjoy. I'm going to get back to prepping.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
